  "description": "Single-file offline HTML application for quality-control review and audit of real-time PCR (qPCR) runs. It reads IXO, EDS/EDT, RDML, ZPCR and PCRD instrument files directly in a web browser, with no installation, server or network connection, and reports stored threshold cycles, amplification curves, melting results and quantity values as recorded in the source file.",
